  31:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c **** /**
  32:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * @ingroup groupFilters
  33:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  */
  34:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c **** 
  35:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c **** /**
  36:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * @defgroup IIR_Lattice Infinite Impulse Response (IIR) Lattice Filters
  37:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  *
  38:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * This set of functions implements lattice filters
  39:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * for Q15, Q31 and floating-point data types.  Lattice filters are used in a
  40:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * variety of adaptive filter applications.  The filter structure has feedforward and
  41:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * feedback components and the net impulse response is infinite length.
  42:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * The functions operate on blocks
  43:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * of input and output data and each call to the function processes
  44:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * <code>blockSize</code> samples through the filter.  <code>pSrc</code> and
  45:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * <code>pDst</code> point to input and output arrays containing <code>blockSize</code> values.
  46:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c **** 
  47:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * \par Algorithm:
  48:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * \image html IIRLattice.gif "Infinite Impulse Response Lattice filter"
  49:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * <pre>
  50:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  *    fN(n)   =  x(n)
  51:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  *    fm-1(n) = fm(n) - km * gm-1(n-1)   for m = N, N-1, ...1
  52:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  *    gm(n)   = km * fm-1(n) + gm-1(n-1) for m = N, N-1, ...1
  53:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  *    y(n)    = vN * gN(n) + vN-1 * gN-1(n) + ...+ v0 * g0(n)
  54:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * </pre>
  55:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * \par
  56:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * <code>pkCoeffs</code> points to array of reflection coefficients of size <code>numStages</code>.
  57:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * Reflection coefficients are stored in time-reversed order.
  58:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * \par
  59:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * <pre>
  60:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  *    {kN, kN-1, ....k1}
  61:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * </pre>
  62:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * <code>pvCoeffs</code> points to the array of ladder coefficients of size <code>(numStages+1)</co
  63:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * Ladder coefficients are stored in time-reversed order.
  64:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * \par
  65:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * <pre>
  66:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  *    {vN, vN-1, ...v0}
  67:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * </pre>
  68:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * <code>pState</code> points to a state array of size <code>numStages + blockSize</code>.
  69:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * The state variables shown in the figure above (the g values) are stored in the <code>pState</cod
  70:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * The state variables are updated after each block of data is processed; the coefficients are unto
  71:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * \par Instance Structure
  72:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * The coefficients and state variables for a filter are stored together in an instance data struct
  73:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * A separate instance structure must be defined for each filter.
  74:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * Coefficient arrays may be shared among several instances while state variable arrays cannot be s
  75:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * There are separate instance structure declarations for each of the 3 supported data types.
  76:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****   *
  77:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * \par Initialization Functions
  78:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * There is also an associated initialization function for each data type.
  79:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * The initialization function performs the following operations:
  80:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * - Sets the values of the internal structure fields.
  81:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * - Zeros out the values in the state buffer.
  82:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * To do this manually without calling the init function, assign the follow subfields of the instan
  83:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * numStages, pkCoeffs, pvCoeffs, pState. Also set all of the values in pState to zero.
  84:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  *
  85:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * \par
ARM GAS  C:\Users\Lamp\AppData\Local\Temp\cclI0jbr.s 			page 3


