  87:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * However, if the initialization function is used, then the instance structure cannot be placed in
  88:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * To place an instance structure into a const data section, the instance structure must be manuall
  89:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * Set the values in the state buffer to zeros and then manually initialize the instance structure 
  90:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_iir_lattice_f32.c ****  * <pre>
